  (text "POWER: slot +5 V -> AP2112K-3.3 -> +3V3 (MCU, MCP2562 VIO, tuner VD, buffer, oscillator). Tuner VA (2.7-5.5 V) comes from +3V3 through a ferrite: +3V3A. The tuner draws about 10 mA on each rail in FM." (at 15 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d3d0d14-1a01-5a2a-b2f8-91295bdb6d2a"))
