  (text "MCU: STM32G0B1KBU6 (UFQFPN-32). Pin use (DS13560 alternate-function tables; CHECK before layout):\nPA11 (22) FDCAN1_RX AF9, PA12 (23) FDCAN1_TX AF9 (SYSCFG remap off).  PB6 (30) I2C1_SCL AF6, PB7 (31) I2C1_SDA AF6: the tuner.\nPB0 (15) tuner RST (output; pulled low, so the tuner stays in reset until the firmware starts).  PB1 (16) tuner INT (GPO2, input).\nPB2 (17) RET buffer enable, ACTIVE LOW (74LVC1G125 OE; 10k pull-up keeps it off at reset and while the MCU is blank).\nPA9 (19) USART1_TX AF1, PA10 (21) USART1_RX AF1: debug (J4, also the ROM bootloader).  PA0 (7) ADC1_IN0: slot ID.  PA5 (12) LED tuned, PA6 (13) LED stereo / RDS.\nPC14 / PC15 (2 / 3): 8 MHz HSE.  PA13 SWDIO, PA14 SWCLK (BOOT0 shares it), PF2 = NRST." (at 170 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8723f9a2-c3ef-5831-b469-b30c9a4dafd2"))
  (symbol (lib_id "RadioCard:STM32G0B1KBU6") (at 210 120 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "5559bc05-c325-5382-aa57-2fe4611df303")
