  (text "REFERENCE CLOCK (PROVISIONAL): the tuner's own crystal oscillator uses GPO3, which is DCLK here, so RCLK comes from a 32.768 kHz CMOS oscillator, +-50 ppm or better (FM seek at 50 kHz and SW need +-50 ppm). AN332 table 6 decides whether another frequency (the rail MCLK, 12.288 MHz) is accepted." (at 15 295 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "946d36b1-8dde-5add-9e92-5826d4436b5a"))
