  (text "ANTENNA (PROVISIONAL, needs AN383): J2 SMA edge-mount on the top edge. FM: antenna -> 1 nF -> FMI. AM: the datasheet circuit is a ferrite loopstick (180-450 uH) between the 0.47 uF / AMI node and RFGND: fit it on J5 (an air loop goes through a 1:5 transformer, not drawn). JP2 (open) would feed the whip to AMI as well: the network for a car whip on AM is in AN383, not in the datasheet, so no values are drawn for it. Keep AM stray capacitance under 10 pF." (at 235 275 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fdd12f50-2b4e-510f-91e4-cbbc596eabcc"))
